You may include and provide unmodified official releases in free modpacks, client bundles, or server bundles, provided that the mod files, attribution, license, and provenance are kept intact, the mod itself is not charged for or resold separately, and the project is not presented as another person's work.

With the copyright holder's explicit prior written consent, and provided that you agree to comply with this notice, the copyright holder may, in the copyright holder's sole discretion, provide some or all of the source code to you for inspection, learning, debugging, private discussion, or other specifically approved written purposes. Any such source-code access is an individual permission arrangement only; it does not make the project publicly open source, does not create a general license, and does not by itself include any right to copy, publicly distribute, republish modified versions, or use the project commercially.

