Except for the limited permission expressly granted above, all rights in and to this project and all related materials are reserved by the copyright holder, including but not limited to source code, bytecode, assets, textures, text, UI, documentation, configuration examples, AI-generated or AI-assisted content, and every other component. Possessing files, viewing source code, reading decompiled output, visiting a repository page, or downloading a release does not create any implied license. If this project is hosted on a public code platform, that public visibility does not grant any additional permission to copy, distribute, modify, reuse, or republish it; except for the minimum technical permissions that the platform must exercise and the law does not allow to be excluded, this notice still controls.

3. Prohibited Acts Without Prior Written Permission
You may not, and may not permit any third party to:
