- publish under the author's name, imply the author's approval of a third-party build, strip provenance, or otherwise create a false impression of affiliation, authorization, partnership, or endorsement.

4. Termination
Any breach of this license notice automatically and immediately terminates the limited permission above. Upon termination, you must stop all use and delete every copy in your possession or control, except where retention is required by law.

5. Backup Copies
You may keep a reasonable number of unmodified copies for personal archival, server deployment, or providing a modpack, client bundle, or server bundle under Section 1. You may not charge for, resell, or release those copies as standalone versions of this mod.

